SimpleLogger simpleLogger;

// Write a log message using SimpleLogger.
kzLog(simpleLogger, KZ_LOG_LEVEL_INFO, KZ_LOG_CATEGORY_GENERIC, ("Lets log 1 + 2 = {}.", 1 + 2));

```
Copy to clipboard
To use a logger in logger chain:

