  1. In the Visual Studio solution of your plugin, in the Solution Explorer right-click the project name, select Add > Reference, and add the reference to the `PresentationCore` assembly.
Kanzi Studio plugin uses this assembly to define the color you use in a Color Brush.
  2. In Visual Studio open the class library file that implements the `PluginCommand` interface and add the using directive for the `System.Windows.Media` in the `WindowsMedia` namespace to prevent conflicts with the Kanzi `PluginInterface` namespace.

